# the images only need the subprojects, so everything else stays out of the build context
*
!ecosim-*

# local environments, build output and caches of the subprojects, the image builds its own
**/.venv
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/report.xml
